        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Support Benefit: Your cat throws your enemies off-balance when you create an opening. Until the start of your next turn, your Strikes that deal damage to a creature within your cat's reach make the target off-guard until the end of your next turn."
